<mvc:View controllerName="sap.erm.app.controller.admin.AuditLog" xmlns:mvc="sap.ui.core.mvc" xmlns="sap.m" xmlns:f="sap.f" xmlns:core="sap.ui.core">
    <f:DynamicPage>
        <f:title>
            <f:DynamicPageTitle>
                <f:heading>
                    <Title text="System Audit Logs" level="H2"/>
                </f:heading>
            </f:DynamicPageTitle>
        </f:title>
        <f:content>
            <Table items="{auditLogModel>/}">
                <columns>
                    <Column><Text text="Timestamp"/></Column>
                    <Column><Text text="User"/></Column>
                    <Column><Text text="Module"/></Column>
                    <Column><Text text="Action"/></Column>
                    <Column><Text text="Document ID"/></Column>
                    <Column><Text text="Status"/></Column>
                </columns>
                <items>
                    <ColumnListItem>
                        <cells>
                            <Text text="{ path: 'auditLogModel>timestamp', formatter: '.formatter.date' }" />
                            <Text text="{auditLogModel>user}" />
                            <Text text="{auditLogModel>module}" />
                            <Text text="{auditLogModel>action}" />
                            <Text text="{auditLogModel>documentId}" />
                            <ObjectStatus text="{auditLogModel>status}" state="{= ${auditLogModel>status} === 'Success' ? 'Success' : 'Error' }" />
                        </cells>
                    </ColumnListItem>
                </items>
            </Table>
        </f:content>
    </f:DynamicPage>
</mvc:View>
